{"id":10327882236219,"title":"FloraFresh - Vaginal Probiotics Gummies","handle":"florafresh-vaginal-probiotics-gummies","description":"\u003cp\u003eFloraFresh Vaginal Probiotics Gummies are formulated to support vaginal health, microbiome balance, and daily feminine wellness through a comprehensive blend of probiotics, prebiotics, and supportive nutrients. Each serving delivers 15 billion CFU from four clinically studied Lactobacillus strains - Lactobacillus rhamnosus, Lactobacillus reuteri, Lactobacillus salivarius, and Lactobacillus gasseri. These beneficial bacteria are among the most researched probiotic strains for supporting a healthy vaginal microbiome and helping maintain the natural balance of vaginal flora. Combined with XOS prebiotics, D-Mannose, and Vitamin C, FloraFresh provides targeted support for women looking to maintain intimate wellness, vaginal pH balance, and overall microbiome health.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe vaginal microbiome plays an important role in supporting comfort, freshness, and a healthy environment throughout different stages of life. Everyday factors such as stress, hormonal fluctuations, menstruation, travel, aging, dietary changes, and antibiotic use can influence the balance of beneficial bacteria. FloraFresh is designed to help replenish and nourish these beneficial microorganisms while supporting the body's natural defenses. The inclusion of XOS prebiotics helps feed probiotic bacteria and promote their growth, while D-Mannose is commonly used as part of feminine wellness routines to support urinary and intimate health. Vitamin C provides additional antioxidant support and contributes to overall wellness.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnlike traditional probiotic capsules, FloraFresh comes in a convenient gummy format that makes daily supplementation simple and enjoyable. The vegan, gluten-free, and sugar-free formula is designed for women seeking a practical way to support vaginal flora balance without adding complexity to their wellness routine. Whether you're looking for a daily vaginal probiotic, support during periods of hormonal change, assistance maintaining a healthy pH balance, or a supplement to help support feminine wellness after travel or antibiotic use, FloraFresh offers a science-backed solution that fits seamlessly into everyday life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy combining clinically studied probiotics with prebiotics and supportive nutrients, FloraFresh helps create an environment where beneficial bacteria can thrive. The result is a daily wellness supplement designed to support vaginal microbiome health, intimate comfort, freshness, and long-term feminine wellness from within.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2026-04-23T21:47:53-07:00","created_at":"2026-04-03T00:18:44-07:00","vendor":"Wellness Nest","type":"Probiotics","tags":[],"price":4099,"price_min":4099,"price_max":4099,"available":true,"price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":5799,"compare_at_price_min":5799,"compare_at_price_max":5799,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"variants":[{"id":51093850390843,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"WNFFPB2025-Pineapple","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"name":"FloraFresh - Vaginal Probiotics Gummies","public_title":null,"options":["Default Title"],"price":4099,"weight":0,"compare_at_price":5799,"inventory_management":"shopify","barcode":"00199874554440","quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"quantity_price_breaks":[],"requires_selling_plan":false,"selling_plan_allocations":[{"price_adjustments":[{"position":1,"price":2049}],"price":2049,"compare_at_price":4099,"per_delivery_price":2049,"selling_plan_id":9849798971,"selling_plan_group_id":"a9a40cd2927428da4bc2349c1c351130be01f60f"},{"price_adjustments":[{"position":1,"price":2391}],"price":2391,"compare_at_price":4099,"per_delivery_price":2391,"selling_plan_id":9849831739,"selling_plan_group_id":"8